# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Anders S Christensen et al. (2020). On the role of gradients for machine learning of molecular energies and forces.
#   Machine Learning: Science and Technology. doi:10.1088/2632-2153/abba6f  arXiv:2007.09593v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2007.09593v1 (sha256 83fb601349f18d80...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 218 (Dataset/benchmark). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/christensen2020.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the revised MD17 (rMD17) data set introduced here and the
# FCHL19 kernel models trained on its ten molecules with energies only,
# forces only, or both, at the largest training-set size N = 1,000
# (Table S1). The smaller training-set sizes of Table S1, the Himmelblau
# toy model and the small-organic-molecule study (learning-curve fits,
# Table 3) are not encoded.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-christensen2020 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Christensen and von Lilienfeld (2020): the role of gradients in machine learning of molecular energies and forces; revised MD17" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-christensen2020 .

entity:article-christensen2020 a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1088/2632-2153/abba6f> ;
    schema:datePublished "2020"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "On the role of gradients for machine learning of molecular energies and forces" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7253-6897> ,
        entity:person-vonLilienfeld-christensen2020 .

<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7253-6897> a schema:Person ;
